	"data": "Astronomy Skill Tree\n\n4-tier skill tree for learning astronomy: Tier 1 (Naked Eye - constellations, planet spotting), Tier 2 (Binoculars - Messier objects, star-hopping), Tier 3 (Telescope + Astrophysics - stellar lifecycle, 6-8\" Dobsonian), Tier 4 (Advanced Amateur - Messier catalog, astrophotography). Key resources: Stellarium (desktop), Crash Course Astronomy (YouTube), 'The Stars' by H.A. Rey, 'NightWatch' by Terence Dickinson. Location context: Mansfield, MA with dark sky access 30-40 min…",
